[change]: Review change and target
[staging]: Verify in staging
[recovery]: Confirm recovery path
[hold]: Check active incident holds
[limited]: Limited rollout
[verify]: Observe user paths and dependencies
[full]: Complete rollout
[inventory]: Update inventory and evidence
[rollback]: Stop and recover
[change] -> [staging]
[staging] -> [recovery]
[recovery] -> [hold]
[hold] -> [limited]: approved
[limited] -> [verify]
[verify] -> [full]: healthy
[verify] --> [rollback]: regression
[full] -> [inventory]
